      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN SCARLETT (2) has been hard to follow lately, running sixth (30.42) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Gosford. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Key player on best and expected to bounce back. ZIPPING VIPER (1) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, grabbed late but holding on to a placing when a 3.5 lengths second (29.84) over 515m at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Bold showing expected. MODEST MAN (7) had a wide draw last time when running fifth (30.14) over 520m at Wentworth Park in a Grade 4/5. Solid record at the distance winning nine races. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Has the ability to give this a shake. IT'S A TEASE (6) showed good early speed and won last start. Big chance on that form.",
